# A server that uses q as a member prefix (owner, ~) has no quiet list:
# Textual refuses /quiet and /unquiet there rather than set the prefix.
! welcome
< :irc.test 005 textual CHANTYPES=# PREFIX=(qov)~@+ :are supported by this server
< :textual!u@h JOIN #c
> MODE #c
! type #c /quiet dave
? line #c The mode +q is not supported on this server
! type #c /unquiet dave
? line #c The mode +q is not supported on this server
! type #c /ban dave
> MODE #c +b dave
? registered textual
